{"text":"kuruntokai","n":44,"lines":["காலே பரிதப் பினவே கண்ணே","நோக்கி நோக்கி வாளிழந் தனவே","அகலிரு விசும்பின் மீனினும்","பலரே மன்றவிவ் வுலகத்துப் பிறரே"],"tr":["kālē paritap piṉavē kaṇṇē","nōkki nōkki vāḷiḻan taṉavē","akaliru vicumpiṉ mīṉiṉum","palarē maṉṟaviv vulakattup piṟarē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"pālai","tinai_ta":"பாலை","speaker_ta":"செவிலித்தாய் கூற்று","poet_ta":"வெள்ளிவீதியார்","speaker_en":"the foster-mother (cevili)","poet_tr":"Veḷḷivītiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"4 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"3×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 14, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 10, veṇṭaḷai 3, kalittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"காலே","tr":"kālē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லே","tr":"lē"}]},{"text":"பரிதப்","tr":"paritap","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பரி","tr":"pari"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தப்","tr":"tap"}]},{"text":"பினவே","tr":"piṉavē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பின","tr":"piṉa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]},{"text":"கண்ணே","tr":"kaṇṇē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கண்","tr":"kaṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணே","tr":"ṇē"}]}],[{"text":"நோக்கி","tr":"nōkki","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நோக்","tr":"nōk"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கி","tr":"ki"}]},{"text":"நோக்கி","tr":"nōkki","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நோக்","tr":"nōk"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கி","tr":"ki"}]},{"text":"வாளிழந்","tr":"vāḷiḻan","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ளிழந்","tr":"ḷiḻan"}]},{"text":"தனவே","tr":"taṉavē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தன","tr":"taṉa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]}],[{"text":"அகலிரு","tr":"akaliru","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அக","tr":"aka"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"லிரு","tr":"liru"}]},{"text":"விசும்பின்","tr":"vicumpiṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"விசும்","tr":"vicum"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பின்","tr":"piṉ"}]},{"text":"மீனினும்","tr":"mīṉiṉum","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மீ","tr":"mī"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"னினும்","tr":"ṉiṉum"}]}],[{"text":"பலரே","tr":"palarē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பல","tr":"pala"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரே","tr":"rē"}]},{"text":"மன்றவிவ்","tr":"maṉṟaviv","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மன்","tr":"maṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றவிவ்","tr":"ṟaviv"}]},{"text":"வுலகத்துப்","tr":"vulakattup","foot":"puḷimāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வுல","tr":"vula"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கத்","tr":"kat"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"துப்","tr":"tup"}]},{"text":"பிறரே","tr":"piṟarē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பிற","tr":"piṟa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரே","tr":"rē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"காலே","parts":[{"text":"கால்","lemma":"கால்","gloss":"leg"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"indeed the legs"},{"surface":"பரிதப்பினவே","parts":[{"text":"பரி","lemma":"பரி","gloss":"speed"},{"text":"தப்பின","lemma":"தப்பு","gloss":"failed"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"have lost their speed"},{"surface":"கண்ணே","parts":[{"text":"கண்","lemma":"கண்","gloss":"eye"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"indeed the eyes"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நோக்கி","parts":[{"text":"நோக்கி","lemma":"நோக்கு","gloss":"looking"}],"gloss":"looking"},{"surface":"நோக்கி","parts":[{"text":"நோக்கி","lemma":"நோக்கு","gloss":"looking"}],"gloss":"looking"},{"surface":"வாளிழந்தனவே","parts":[{"text":"வாள்","lemma":"வாள்","gloss":"brightness"},{"text":"இழந்தன","lemma":"இழ","gloss":"lost"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"have lost their brightness"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அகலிரு","parts":[{"text":"அகல்","lemma":"அகல்","gloss":"wide"},{"text":"இரு","lemma":"இரு","gloss":"vast"}],"gloss":"wide and vast"},{"surface":"விசும்பின்","parts":[{"text":"விசும்பு","lemma":"விசும்பு","gloss":"sky"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of the sky"},{"surface":"மீனினும்","parts":[{"text":"மீன்","lemma":"மீன்","gloss":"star"},{"text":"இனும்","lemma":"இனும்","gloss":"than"}],"gloss":"more than the stars"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பலரே","parts":[{"text":"பலர்","lemma":"பலர்","gloss":"many people"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"are indeed many"},{"surface":"மன்ற","parts":[{"text":"மன்ற","lemma":"மன்ற","gloss":"surely"}],"gloss":"surely"},{"surface":"இவ்வுலகத்து","parts":[{"text":"இவ்வுலகத்து","lemma":"இவ்வுலகத்து","gloss":"of this world"}],"gloss":"of this world","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பிறரே","parts":[{"text":"பிறர்","lemma":"பிறர்","gloss":"others"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"others indeed"}]}],"literal":"My legs indeed have lost their speed, my eyes indeed / looking and looking, have lost their brightness / than the stars of the wide, vast sky / surely, many indeed are the others in this world.","translation":"My legs have lost their strength from walking. My eyes have lost their brightness from searching and searching. Yet, those who are strangers in this world are surely more numerous than the stars in the wide, vast sky.","modern":"என் கால்கள் நடந்து நடந்து வலிமை இழந்துவிட்டன. என் கண்கள் தேடித் தேடிப் பார்த்துத் தம் ஒளியை இழந்துவிட்டன. அகன்ற பெரிய வானத்தில் உள்ள விண்மீன்களைக் காட்டிலும், இவ்வுலகத்தில் உள்ள பிற மனிதர்கள் மிகவும் பலராவர்.","explanation":"This poem is set in the desert landscape (pālai tiṇai), where a foster-mother laments her futile search for her eloped daughter and her lover. She expresses her physical and emotional exhaustion, stating that her legs can no longer walk and her eyes have grown dim from constant searching. The vastness of her despair is highlighted by comparing the indifferent strangers she encounters to the countless stars in the night sky. Despite the world being crowded with people, none of them are the loved ones she seeks, intensifying her sense of isolation. The key terms 'paritappal' (exhaustion of legs) and 'piṟar' (strangers) underscore the theme of separation and loneliness.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.66],[0.66,0.8],[0.8,1.6],[1.6,3.0],[3.0,3.1],[3.1,3.74],[3.74,4.1],[4.1,5.4],[5.4,6.0],[6.0,6.0],[6.0,7.7],[7.7,7.9],[8.01,8.9],[8.9,9.0]],"female":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.66],[0.66,0.8],[0.8,1.7],[1.7,3.1],[3.1,3.3],[3.3,3.7],[3.95,4.7],[4.7,6.1],[6.1,6.7],[6.7,6.8],[6.8,8.5],[8.5,8.6],[8.71,9.6],[9.6,9.7]]}}